  "description": "The META TR V4 ESSENTIAL plays the classy card. Black components, a matte finish, and a strong performer.\n• The FOX 36 Performance fork has a rigid chassis for maximum precision. Equipped with the GRIP cartridge with three positions and the Float Evol air spring, riders can adjust firmness to their weight and preferences. The Float DPS shock suits all riders thanks to its air spring and offers three-position compression adjustment.\n• SHIMANO SLX 4-piston brakes stop effectively in all conditions.\n• The wheelset features DT SWISS M 502 rims and DT hubs. A perfect balance between weight and strength.\n• A SHIMANO SLX 12-speed drivetrain with a 10-51 cassette is perfect for climbing.",
